Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On my journey with Akari,\Nwe stopped by the port city of Libelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Off the coast of the city was a prison of fog with one\Nof the Four Major Human Errors sealed within:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.17,0:00:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Pandemonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I attempted to trap Akari within the\NPandemonium to dispose of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.63,0:00:23.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,but Akari used her Pure Concept of [Time]\N{\rSubtitle}to return as if nothing had happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.21,0:02:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:14.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, don't stick yourself out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:19.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It reminds me of when I almost\Ndrowned a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.38,0:02:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You fell in the ocean before, Menou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.33,0:02:26.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was back when I was little, here in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:28.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In Libelle? You never told me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.83,0:02:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you were cute even if you were drowning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.79,0:02:34.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Any other memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.46,0:02:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This was where I found out that Master Flare\Nwas an Executioner who killed otherworlders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.92,0:02:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nothing in particular. It was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:57.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There you are, Flarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.88,0:03:03.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.63,0:03:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's so lively!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not just tourists. The locals frequent this place, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:12.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's probably the most crowded place in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fish... Fruit...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.21,0:03:20.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're etheric tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Etheric tools"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're items that channel magecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:27.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think those were probably\Nunearthed from an ancient ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.25,0:03:32.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Towns that are adjacent to the Wild Frontier\Nhave these kinds of shops that-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:34.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Akari?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:35.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.33,0:03:40.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you're the one who asked the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.71,0:03:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here, Menou. Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.17,0:03:46.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:54.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?! It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's watermelon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:57.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, watermelon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.54,0:04:01.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a little different from the watermelon I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.25,0:04:04.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but yeah, I guess the flavor is close to watermelon...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:07.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's different about the watermelon you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.25,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Let's see, it's usually red, though sometimes yellow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.25,0:04:12.67,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,That man... He looks like he's just walking,\N{\rSubtitle-3}Let's see, it's usually red, though sometimes yellow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.67,0:04:13.29,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,That man... He looks like he's just walking,\N{\rSubtitle-3}And there are seeds all over,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:14.25,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,but it's obvious he's monitoring us.\N{\rSubtitle-3}And there are seeds all over,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:15.75,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,but it's obvious he's monitoring us.\N{\rSubtitle-3}just enough so they don't get in the way of eating...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:17.08,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,just enough so they don't get in the way of eating...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is this, Menou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please calm down, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:33.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get down on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why here, of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, will you hold this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:41.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-Menou! What do I do with this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would say you live up to your\Nname as Flare's apprentice,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you forgot something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:58.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-sorry, Menou...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're part of the Fourth, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:04.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is an awfully aggressive welcome,\Nbut what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:08.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We want to eliminate you of course, Flarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.67,0:05:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see. So they're not after Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We got word that you thwarted some of our\Ncomrades who were active in Grisarika.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.58,0:05:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've had our eyes on you ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean those terrorists on the train?\NThey were members of the Fourth, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.17,0:05:32.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I see the resemblance.\NLike your amateurish tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:36.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand the situation you're in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:40.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're the one who doesn't seem to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That idiot is just a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:55.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Die, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:05:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You little...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:02.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That takes care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.79,0:06:05.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Amazing as always, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:09.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where are the ruffians?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.17,0:06:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The knights are finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that was a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.75,0:06:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He did say he would attack her,\Nbut I never thought it would be right after the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:21.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So that's Flarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:24.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I believe the other girl called her "Menou"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:28.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Beautiful and strong... It hardly seems fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:31.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, can I take this, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.71,0:06:36.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those two are definitely going to talk, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:37.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's the one who spoke ill\Nof my mother during the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:48.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What should we do now, Menou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.04,0:07:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, the church needs me there this evening, but-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:05.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You stay here, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.75,0:07:09.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:11.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-they suddenly transformed into monsters...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:13.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Monsters"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:24.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:30.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You may enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.63,0:07:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must be Ms. Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.33,0:07:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, Pastor Sicilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's an honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:42.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No need for compliments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I heard you made a big show of\Nfighting in the market earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't say I'm impressed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,given you're an Executioner\Nwith an otherworlder with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The situation was unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And afterwards, I came across a number of odd things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:05.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that so. But first, let's discuss this odd item here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your approval form for travel funds...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It doesn't specify the most important detail:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:17.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,how you intend to dispose of\Nyour otherworlder companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't actually intend on taking\Nher to the Sanctuary, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:26.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no such place that\N"takes otherworlders in," after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:29.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm continuing to look for a way to kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.71,0:08:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll find a way before we get to the Sanctuary!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:37.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So you want more money for this journey\Nbased on such an ambiguous promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:40.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, if it's a fair transaction where\NI compensate you for your labor,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.63,0:08:48.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there might be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.58,0:08:53.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see, so the usual, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:56.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do I need to investigate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:58.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Monstrine"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.75,0:09:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, because it's "monstrous," I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:06.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a drug that's being dealt around\Ntown that supposedly induces euphoria.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's a sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, this etheric reaction...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:12.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's sin magecraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And invoking sin magecraft most often\Ninvolves a human body, spirit, or soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.67,0:09:22.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...there are people being sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:28.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.04,0:09:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But the odd thing is that there are very few\Npeople who have gone missing in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:37.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe they were just never reported missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not all that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I actually got attacked by the Fourth earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After they got captured they turned into monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to Pastor Sicilia,\Nit has something to do with this "monstrine."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:55.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why would they turn some of their own?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:10:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In any case, we have to investigate.\NFor the sake of travel funds, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:03.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could you look into the supply chain, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:04.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to do anything that makes\Nthings easier for you, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:13.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Though it really ticks me off that it's for\Nyour journey with that stupid set of boobs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:17.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,More! I want more pats on the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.58,0:10:19.88,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,While you're looking into that,\N{\rSubtitle}More! I want more pats on the head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:22.00,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,I'll investigate from a different angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:33.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?! I can't see anything in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.33,0:10:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoops?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:39.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Splash! Shake shake shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:41.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.88,0:10:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Were you planning to crush me\Nto death with your weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.83,0:10:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were taking so long to get up,\Nso I just figured I'd wake you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:59.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there were better ways to wake me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.71,0:11:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I got carried away with my love for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.79,0:11:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, owww!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.17,0:11:12.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it's so unusual, you know? You waking up so late!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:14.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.83,0:11:18.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it because the pastor wanted you at the church?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you two get up to some "fun" last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.71,0:11:21.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.71,0:11:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oof...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The figurehead of the Fourth in this city, Manon Libelle...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to find a way to investigate her affairs...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:32.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:36.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lady Manon, you're the one who suggested\Nwe distribute that monstrine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.54,0:11:38.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's quite correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:43.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monstrine provides euphoria and is\Nhighly addictive to those who take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:47.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what you said when you brought\Nin that etheric tool for producing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, the drug for distribution has\Nbeen adjusted to be that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not only is it a way to fund our activities,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:12:01.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but those who take it can potentially be\Nused as hostages to stave off the Faust.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As a final resort,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:05.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we could turn them into monsters\Nand use them as weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.79,0:12:09.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:13.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, why did Kaiser turn into a monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:15.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's a member of our council!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kaiser...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean the man from yesterday!\NThe reason is simple enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I laced the food I served during\Nthe meetings with monstrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:27.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What have you done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:31.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why you little...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:33.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.25,0:13:14.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, um, are there any other complaints?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a failure who never inherited your mother's power.\NHow dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's simple, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:29.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A certain individual asked me to spread monstrine,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.21,0:13:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in return for help in enacting my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.71,0:13:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Revenge"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flarette, the apprentice to Flare, who killed my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.21,0:13:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once I knew she was coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.33,0:13:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it was only natural that I wanted to give her a\N"proper" welcome, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:56.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm making all kinds of arrangements,\Nso I do hope you'll all cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut that out! What did we ever do to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like I said, just tell me what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You lot are the dregs of society.\NYou must have used monstrine, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-we've got nothin' to do with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our leader told us never to touch the stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:42.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A delinquent leader with morals?\NI'd love to see the person's face!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.75,0:14:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This way, Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, this voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:52.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, whoever you are,\NI won't have you messing with my...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:58.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't Momo!\NTo think we'd reunite in a place like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You die here, crappy little princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I must say, I'm so glad we get to talk like this, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.04,0:15:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once my initial surprise attack failed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew prolonging the fight would\Nonly please you, Little Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:20.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've come to know me too well, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you have died in those ruins?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, those gargoyles there were quite a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.75,0:15:32.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Enemies based on the concept\Nof original sin are troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm especially poorly matched against demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.63,0:15:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because your only strategy is brute force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Though gargoyles are inferior,\Njust stone statues with demons infused in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're actually closer to monsters than demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.58,0:15:51.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're inanimate objects that had their\Ncomposition changed by taking in demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:56.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monsters are basically creatures that have\Nmutated by taking in original sin, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:16:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never gave thought to what monsters might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course you didn't, Little Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, until about a thousand years\Nago before sin magecraft existed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.13,0:16:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,demons and monsters didn't even exist, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What happened a thousand years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no reason I should have to explain this, but fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know the Pandemonium that's\Noff the coast of this city?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's the fog that has one of the\NFour Major Human Errors sealed within.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:31.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That Human Error was originally a\Nvery young girl from another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With her Pure Concept,\Nthe girl's fantasies materialized into demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the blood and flesh that\Nfell from her became monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:47.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,An inferior imitation of her Pure Concept [Chaos]\N{\rSubtitle}became what we know as sin magecraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:48.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the thing sealed within the Pandemonium is the\Nvery source of the monsters that ravage our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But anyway, why are you playing boss to those lowlifes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:08.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're actually quite candid and likable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:10.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And why were you picking on them, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:13.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was just looking for info on monstrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:18.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, I hear you told them to stay away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed. I saw the Fourth trying to deal it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That stuff is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.63,0:17:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You aren't famous for going around righting\Nwrongs for nothing, Princess Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.83,0:17:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you couldn't bear to put up with it either, am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:37.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't that why you were so intent on your investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:41.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shall I share my information with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I already have a lead to where\Nthe drug is being produced.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:48.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can find that out myself, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.79,0:17:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't want to be in my debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.13,0:17:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then what if we strike a deal instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.79,0:17:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll give you my information if you'll compete with\Nme to see who's infiltration gets better results.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:01.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm planning to investigate a different place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.67,0:18:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The prime suspect behind the distribution\Nof monstrine is Manon Libelle,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.17,0:18:12.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and this is the invitation to a\Nball she's hosting tomorrow evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think you're at all cut out to infiltrate\Nor investigate anything, Little Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm capable in everything I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm confident in my ability to\Nsniff out a target's vulnerabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.63,0:18:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Sniff out"? That sure sounds impractical!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:30.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll compete if you're so confident, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.58,0:18:38.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let us see who manages to get more information.\NWe'll meet back here at midnight tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So anyway, that crappy little princess was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How did she wind up as the\Nboss of some delinquents?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, it's impressive she found out\Nwhere the drug is being produced.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she just has too much time on her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,More importantly, about Manon Libelle's evening ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:19:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have information on that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.25,0:19:04.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pastor Sicilia arranged for me to get an invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll have to be careful if the princess is attending as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:10.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'm just going as a nameless\Npriestess accompanying the pastor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:11.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so there shouldn't be any-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, you can't! You have to let me make a dress for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going to spy on the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:22.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why would you dress so obviously\Nlike a priestess in enemy territory?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.25,0:19:25.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And more importantly,\Ndressing you up is a mandatory requirement!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.88,0:19:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it's tomorrow evening.\NThere's no time to be making a dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One night is all I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:36.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's decided, then! Okay, I have to go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.79,0:19:40.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh well. She doesn't listen once she's in that mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:44.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Speaking of not listening, there's that other one...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:46.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to go, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:48.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You get to go into that castle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And only you get to go? It's so not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not a matter of fairness. It's for work!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What if I get abducted while you're gone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.21,0:20:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll at least say a prayer to our Lord\Nfor the precious life that was lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.42,0:20:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?! That's super mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not like you have anything you\Ncould wear to a ball, anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.21,0:20:10.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have my school uniform, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanna go! I wanna go! I wanna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.63,0:20:15.88,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Come on, you know you can't afford to stand out.\N{\rSubtitle}I wanna go! I wanna go! I wanna go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.33,0:20:24.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see, I wonder where my darling Menou could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.83,0:20:28.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's Pastor Sicilia there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:30.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Which must mean somewhere nearby...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.42,0:20:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh! There she is! Aww, she's so lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just love it when she's all dressed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.83,0:20:46.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much Pastor Sicilia,\Nfor allowing such an unreasonable request.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's better if no one can tell you're a priestess,\Nand whatever you decide to wear-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:56.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, not about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:01.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is Boobalicious there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.29,0:21:09.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou! How do I look?\NI'm a pure, just, and strong priestess!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:12.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, Pastor Sicilia...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for arranging an invitation for Akari as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I must say I'm a little worried,\Nbut she's your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.38,0:21:23.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.92,0:21:28.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait for me, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why does Boobalicious get to see Menou in the\Ndress I made for her up close when I don't?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:36.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:39.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I want to quell this rage I'm feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.92,0:21:43.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to destroy the place they\Nproduce monstrine at the very least!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:49.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for coming, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.00,0:21:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do hope you'll enjoy the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.92,0:21:56.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've prepared a plentiful feast for you to enjoy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.21,0:22:02.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Manon Libelle...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:39.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next episode: At the Evening Ball
